[24.719461, "o", "Field notes from the last lab rotation.\r\n\r\nSome pourers still emit older MARK blobs. Sister benches retarget admit onto\r\nSLOT lab so those blobs load. This bench still needs spin to refuse fixtures\r\nunder /app/tapewell/fixtures when the blob cannot be interpreted.\r\n\r\nLinked hull also defines sel_bank; `nm --defined-only /app/bin/nockreel` lists it.\r\n"]
